      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stone_Ridge%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "On the north side, runoff feeds Broad Run, which also drains into the Potomac River system.",
